---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"; // must match your layout's real file name and folder
---

<Layout
  title="Support Area | Uncore Digital"
  description="Get help from Uncore Digital: contact channels, what to include in a support request, support for existing clients, and answers to common questions."
>
  <!-- Canonical + social tags, placed in <head> through your existing custom-css slot -->
  <Fragment slot="custom-css">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://uncoredigital.com/support-area" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Support Area | Uncore Digital" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Get help from Uncore Digital: contact channels, support requests and helpful resources."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://uncoredigital.com/support-area" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Support Area Hero Start -->
  <section class="sa-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="sa-hero__eyebrow poppins-bold">Support</span>
      <h1 class="sa-hero__title poppins-bold">Support Area</h1>
      <p class="sa-hero__meta montserrat-regular">
        Need help with your project, website or campaign? You're in the right
        place.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Support Area Hero End -->

  <!-- Support Area Start -->
  <section class="sa-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sa-layout">
        <!-- Table of contents -->
        <aside class="sa-toc">
          <p class="sa-toc__title poppins-bold">On this page</p>
          <ol class="sa-toc__list montserrat-regular">
            <li><a href="#overview">How we help</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact-channels">Contact channels</a></li>
            <li><a href="#what-to-include">What to include in your request</a></li>
            <li><a href="#existing-clients">Support for existing clients</a></li>
            <li><a href="#common-topics">Common support topics</a></li>
            <li><a href="#response">Response and escalation</a></li>
            <li><a href="#security">Reporting a security or privacy concern</a></li>
            <li><a href="#resources">Helpful resources</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact us</a></li>
          </ol>
        </aside>

        <!-- Support text -->
        <article class="sa-content montserrat-regular">
          <section id="overview">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">1. How we help</h2>
            <p>
              Our job doesn't end at launch. Whether you're a current client, a
              past client or a new visitor with a question, our team is here to
              help you get the most out of your website, product or marketing
              campaigns.
            </p>
            <p>
              Use this page to find the right way to reach us, to tell us what
              you need, and to find answers to common questions quickly.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact-channels">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">2. Contact channels</h2>
            <p>Choose whichever way is easiest for you:</p>
            <div class="sa-cards">
              <a
                class="sa-card"
                href="mailto:connect@uncoredigital.com?subject=Support%20Request"
              >
                <i class="ph ph-envelope-simple-open"></i>
                <span class="sa-card__label poppins-bold">Email us</span>
                <span class="sa-card__value">connect@uncoredigital.com</span>
              </a>
              <a class="sa-card" href="tel:+919725518964">
                <i class="ph ph-phone-call"></i>
                <span class="sa-card__label poppins-bold">Call us</span>
                <span class="sa-card__value">+91 97255 18964</span>
              </a>
              <a class="sa-card" href="/contact-us">
                <i class="ph ph-chat-circle-text"></i>
                <span class="sa-card__label poppins-bold">Contact form</span>
                <span class="sa-card__value">Send us a message online</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p>
              You can also use the chat assistant on our website for quick
              questions, and our team will follow up where needed.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="what-to-include">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">3. What to include in your request</h2>
            <p>
              The more detail you give us, the faster we can help. Where
              possible, please include:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Your name, company and the best email or phone number to reach you</li>
              <li>The website, product or campaign your question is about</li>
              <li>A clear description of the issue or what you would like changed</li>
              <li>Steps to reproduce the problem, if something isn't working</li>
              <li>Screenshots, screen recordings or links that show the issue</li>
              <li>The device, browser and operating system you were using</li>
              <li>How urgent the request is and any deadline that applies</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              Please don't send passwords, payment card numbers or other
              sensitive credentials by email or chat. If we need access to a
              system, we will agree a secure way to share it with you.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="existing-clients">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">4. Support for existing clients</h2>
            <p>
              If you're already working with us, contact your project lead
              directly, or write to us at the email above and mention your
              project name so we can route your request to the right person.
            </p>
            <p>
              The scope of post-launch support, such as maintenance, updates and
              optimisation, is agreed with you before the project begins. If
              you're unsure what your agreement covers, just ask and we will
              explain.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="common-topics">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">5. Common support topics</h2>
            <p>We regularly help with:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Websites and apps:</strong> bugs, content updates,
                speed, hosting and new features
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Digital marketing:</strong> campaign questions,
                reporting and changes to your strategy
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Digital transformation:</strong> CRM setups, workflow
                automation and internal tools
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Accounts and access:</strong> logins, permissions and
                handover of files and assets
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Billing and agreements:</strong> questions about
                proposals, invoices and scope
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section id="response">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">6. Response and escalation</h2>
            <p>
              We aim to respond to every request promptly and to keep you
              updated until it is resolved. Urgent issues, such as a website
              being down, should be reported by phone and email so that the
              right person sees them quickly.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you feel a request hasn't been handled the way it should, tell
              us at
              <a href="mailto:connect@uncoredigital.com?subject=Escalation"
                >connect@uncoredigital.com</a
              >
              with the subject "Escalation" and we will review it at a senior
              level.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="security">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">7. Reporting a security or privacy concern</h2>
            <p>
              If you think you've found a security problem on our website, or
              you have a concern about how your personal information is handled,
              please email
              <a href="mailto:connect@uncoredigital.com?subject=Security%20Report"
                >connect@uncoredigital.com</a
              >
              with a short description of what you found. Please give us a
              reasonable time to look into it before sharing the details
              publicly.
            </p>
            <p>
              To exercise your privacy rights, such as access or deletion of
              your data, see our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="resources">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">8. Helpful resources</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <a href="/faq">Frequently Asked Questions</a> – quick answers
                about our services, process, pricing and support
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> – how we collect
                and protect your information
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/our-portfolio">Our Portfolio</a> – examples of our
                work
              </li>
              <li>
                <a href="/team">Our Team</a> – the people you will be working
                with
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section id="contact">
            <h2 class="poppins-bold">9. Contact us</h2>
            <p>Still need a hand? Reach out and we'll get back to you.</p>
            <div class="sa-contact">
              <p><strong>Uncore Digital</strong></p>
              <p>
                Email:
                <a href="mailto:connect@uncoredigital.com"
                  >connect@uncoredigital.com</a
                >
              </p>
              <p>Phone: +91 97255 18964</p>
              <p>626 RXR Plaza, Uniondale, NY 11556, USA</p>
              <p>1013, Ratnanjali, Solitaire, India</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Support Area End -->
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .sa-hero {
    background: #121212;
    padding: 190px 0 70px; /* top padding clears the fixed header */
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sa-hero__eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #caf310;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .sa-hero__title {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .sa-hero__meta {
    color: #a3a3a3;
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Body */
  .sa-body {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 70px 0 100px;
  }

  .sa-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 270px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Table of contents */
  .sa-toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 130px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #f6f7f4;
    border: 1px solid #e8eadf;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .sa-toc__title {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #000;
  }

  .sa-toc__list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .sa-toc__list a {
    color: #4a5565;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .sa-toc__list a:hover {
    color: #000;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #caf310;
    text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* Content */
  .sa-content {
    color: #2b2f36;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .sa-content section {
    scroll-margin-top: 130px;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;
  }

  .sa-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sa-content h2 {
    color: #000;
    font-size: 26px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .sa-content p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #2b2f36;
  }

  .sa-content ul {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .sa-content li {
    color: #2b2f36;
  }

  .sa-content a:not(.sa-card) {
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #caf310;
    text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .sa-content a:not(.sa-card):hover {
    background: #caf310;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* Contact channel cards */
  .sa-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 18px 0 20px;
  }

  .sa-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 22px 20px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e4e8ee;
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: #101828;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.25s ease,
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .sa-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: #caf310;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.1);
  }

  .sa-card i {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    background: #caf310;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .sa-card__label {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #000;
  }

  .sa-card__value {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #4a5565;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .sa-contact {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 22px 26px;
    background: #f6f7f4;
    border-left: 4px solid #caf310;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .sa-contact p {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .sa-hero {
      padding: 150px 0 50px;
    }

    .sa-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .sa-toc {
      position: static;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .sa-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>